<p><em>Last updated: November 17, 2026 · Last verified: November 17, 2026 — pricing and export limits checked against vendor pricing pages</em></p>

<p>Vertical short-form editing is now its own product category, separate from general video editing. The job is narrow and repetitive: trim to 60 seconds, caption every word, reframe to 9:16, export at a size each platform accepts, repeat fifteen times. The tools below are the ones built for that loop rather than adapted to it.</p>

<p>They bill three different ways — a free tier with paid upgrades, per-credit plans, and per-seat subscriptions — which makes headline prices misleading. A $19 credit plan and a $19 seat plan can differ by an order of magnitude in how many finished clips you get, so each entry below converts the vendor's credits into clips or export minutes wherever the vendor publishes the conversion.</p>

