<p>CapCut remains the reference point for a free vertical editor: a real timeline, per-platform export presets, auto-captions, and templates that already know TikTok and Reels timings. If your output is a handful of shorts a week, the free tier does the work and costs nothing — which is a genuinely rare thing in this category.</p>
<p>Paid tiers (Pro, Ultra, Teams) add AI credits, premium templates, 1 TB storage and faster rendering, with a 7-day Pro trial that does not require a card. The catch is regional: CapCut quotes prices in local currency and states that displayed pricing is for reference only until you sign in, so any dollar figure you read in a review may not apply to your account.</p>

