<h2>3. OpusClip — Best for Automated Clip Selection</h2>
<p>OpusClip's value is triage: point it at a long video or a YouTube link and it returns vertical clips with animated captions and a virality score, so you can rank ten candidates before watching any of them. For a channel sitting on hours of existing long-form content, that is the fastest route from archive to feed.</p>
<p>Free allows one clip a day, 9:16 only, with a watermark on animated captions and three-day export access. Starter is $15/month and removes the watermark while adding the virality score, YouTube auto-import, custom reframing and 30-day media retention. Pro is $29/month for 1:1 and 16:9, topics search, prompt-to-clip, custom fonts and API access.</p>

